s="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260504/69f771dc6366d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260504/69f771dc6366d.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">巴萨主场2-0战胜皇马，巴萨积91分提前3轮锁定西甲冠军+主场成功卫冕。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-11/match1713737date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">3连胜！阿森纳1-0西汉姆多赛5分领跑 特罗萨德制胜本·怀特伤退</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260511/zhanbao_image_1713737_1778433801_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260511/zhanbao_image_1713737_1778433801_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260511/zhanbao_image_1713737_1778433801_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">特罗萨德制胜，卡勒姆·威尔逊补时破门，但因为巴勃罗先对拉亚犯规进球被吹。阿森纳1-0西汉姆联，英超三连胜，先赛一场5分领跑；西汉姆联队积36分仍处降级区。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-11/match1711051date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">近6轮4负！米兰2-3亚特兰大 恩昆库造点+点射帕夫洛维奇破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260511/zhanbao_image_1711051_1778445690_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260511/zhanbao_image_1711051_1778445690_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260511/zhanbao_image_1711051_1778445690_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">AC米兰2-3亚特兰大，遭遇两连败，近6轮输掉4场，积67分仍排在积分榜第四位。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-11/match1711058date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">积分追平米兰！罗马3-2帕尔马 马伦双响+点射绝杀伦施替补破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260511/zhanbao_image_1711058_1778436035_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260511/zhanbao_image_1711058_1778436035_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.du