ont-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.79" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260511/202605110308233655_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260511/202605110308233655_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">本轮英超，阿森纳1-0击败西汉姆。赛后，阿尔特塔出席新闻发布会。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-11/6a00cd796d08dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">塔帅：对方绝平球犯规毫无争议 想拿重磅荣誉就得经历生死瞬间</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="2.15" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260511/202605110226172734.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="2.15" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="2.15" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260511/202605110226172734.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260511/202605110226172734.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">英超第36轮，阿森纳客场1-0力克西汉姆联，赛后阿森纳主帅阿尔特塔接受采访。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-11/6a00e2c9948cbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">特罗萨德：决定性时刻拉亚总能挺身而出 厄德高的跑动非常精彩</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.55" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260511/202605110401587495.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.55" sty